    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raise Dragons</h2><br>Have you ever wanted to care for your own pet dragon? Craft tasty treats and sparkling rubs for hand-animated dragons, whose colors and features change every generation depending on how to raise them. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/16a9a1e64377eee958805afafe497faa.poster.avif?t=1750458562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/16a9a1e64377eee958805afafe497faa.webm?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/16a9a1e64377eee958805afafe497faa.mp4?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Colorful World</h2><br>Fly your dragons over a colorful, procedurally-generated world and collect crafting materials to bring home. As your dragons improve, you can fly farther and explore more, creating your own paintings across the sky. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/c674c50194610af9f5384413f931aeb8.poster.avif?t=1750458562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/c674c50194610af9f5384413f931aeb8.webm?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/c674c50194610af9f5384413f931aeb8.mp4?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reveal Your Future</h2><br>Each time you play, you'll receive a custom tarot reading featuring beautiful cards illustrated by SmallBu Studio and Shan Horan. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/6ca9f8603d27bd001d1b04f7db212104.poster.avif?t=1750458562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/6ca9f8603d27bd001d1b04f7db212104.webm?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/6ca9f8603d27bd001d1b04f7db212104.mp4?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raise Dragons</h2><br>Have you ever wanted to care for your own pet dragon? Craft tasty treats and sparkling rubs for hand-animated dragons, whose colors and features change every generation depending on how to raise them. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/16a9a1e64377eee958805afafe497faa.poster.avif?t=1750458562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/16a9a1e64377eee958805afafe497faa.webm?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/16a9a1e64377eee958805afafe497faa.mp4?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Colorful World</h2><br>Fly your dragons over a colorful, procedurally-generated world and collect crafting materials to bring home. As your dragons improve, you can fly farther and explore more, creating your own paintings across the sky. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/c674c50194610af9f5384413f931aeb8.poster.avif?t=1750458562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/c674c50194610af9f5384413f931aeb8.webm?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/c674c50194610af9f5384413f931aeb8.mp4?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reveal Your Future</h2><br>Each time you play, you'll receive a custom tarot reading featuring beautiful cards illustrated by SmallBu Studio and Shan Horan. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/6ca9f8603d27bd001d1b04f7db212104.poster.avif?t=1750458562\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/6ca9f8603d27bd001d1b04f7db212104.webm?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/6ca9f8603d27bd001d1b04f7db212104.mp4?t=1750458562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
